    renteStatTotal: 'Total cost',
    renteBtnCalc: 'Calculate effective rate',
    renteRVerdict: 'Enter loan amount and rate to see the calculation',
    renteVerdictAbove: 'The effective rate is {diff} percentage points above the nominal rate, because the fees and the monthly addition of interest are included.',
    renteVerdictEqual: 'Effective rate is practically equal to nominal — minimal fees.',
    renteHowtoTitle: 'How to use the Effective Rate calculator',
    renteHowtoLead: 'The effective rate is the actual cost of the loan — not just the nominal rate the bank advertises. It includes all fees and charges.',
    renteHowtoP1: '<strong>Loan amount</strong> is what you borrow. <strong>Nominal rate</strong> is what the bank quotes, before fees.',
