"Kalkulatoren fyller inn snittpriser: 21,50 kr/L for bensin, 19,80 kr/L for diesel og 1,80 kr/kWh for strøm. Priser svinger, så bytt dem gjerne ut med det du faktisk betaler for et mer presist svar.":"The calculator fills in average prices: 21,50 kr/L for petrol, 19,80 kr/L for diesel and 1,80 kr/kWh for electricity. Prices fluctuate, so feel free to replace them with what you actually pay for a more precise answer.",
"Hvorfor står det 3,50 kr/km i grafen?":"Why does the chart show 3,50 kr/km?",
"Det er satsen for skattefri kilometergodtgjørelse med bil i 2026. Får du mer per kilometer fra jobben, skattes det av resten. Satsen sier ingenting om hva bilen faktisk koster deg. Kilde: Skatteetaten, satser for kilometergodtgjørelse.":"It is the tax-free mileage allowance rate for a car in 2026. If your employer pays you more per kilometre, the excess is taxed. The rate says nothing about what the car actually costs you. Source: Skatteetaten (the Norwegian Tax Administration), rates for mileage allowance.",
