"Paragrafene er samlet etter tema og forklart kort, ikke gjengitt ordrett. For autoritativ tekst, se Lovdata.":"The sections are grouped by topic and briefly explained, not quoted word for word. This English version is an unofficial translation, and the Norwegian original applies. For the authoritative Norwegian text, see Lovdata.",
